PATENT CONSIDERATIONS

This software implements DAB/DAB+ stream analysis functionality. DAB/DAB+
technologies may be subject to various patents. The use of this software
does not grant any patent licenses. Users are responsible for ensuring
compliance with applicable patent requirements in their jurisdiction.

For commercial use, particularly broadcast applications, users should:
1. Consult with qualified patent attorneys
2. Evaluate patent licensing requirements for DAB/DAB+ technologies
3. Consider audio codec patent implications (especially with FDK-AAC)

